  <Docs>
    <summary>Defines battery capacity level values used by the Android OS API.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>The BatteryManager class contains strings and constants used for values in the Intent.ACTION_BATTERY_CHANGED Intent, and provides a method for querying battery and charging properties.</para>
